@page "/"

<PageTitle>WysiMd.Blazor — Demos</PageTitle>

<h1>WysiMd.Blazor <span class="badge">v1.0.0</span></h1>
<p>
    A WYSIWYG Markdown editor Razor component for Blazor. Supports Visual and Raw modes,
    toolbar customisation, dark/light themes, table editing, undo/redo, and more —
    with minimal JavaScript.
</p>

<h2>Quick Install</h2>
<pre><code>dotnet add package WysiMd.Blazor</code></pre>

<h2>Demos</h2>
<ul>
    <li><a href="/demo/basic">Basic Usage</a> — minimal setup</li>
    <li><a href="/demo/options">Options</a> — interactive EditorOptions playground</li>
    <li><a href="/demo/dark-theme">Dark Theme</a> — dark / light toggle</li>
    <li><a href="/demo/readonly">Read Only</a> — preview mode with no editing</li>
    <li><a href="/demo/toolbar">Toolbar Customization</a> — reorder, hide, override items</li>
    <li><a href="/demo/form">Form Integration</a> — inside an EditForm with validation</li>
    <li><a href="/demo/mobile">Mobile View</a> — responsive design</li>
</ul>
